data.creator_notes:
Comes with 6 greetings:
- Comfy time by the campfire after long day of scavenging;
- Your shelter becomes unusable, time to travel through the snow again;
- It's your birthday, she remembered it and cooks you something from her hidden stash;
- She gets wounded while fending off catgirl that has gone feral;
- After not showering or bathing for days, she gets self conscious about her smell;
- Night gets particularly cold, she offers her fluff to keep you warm;
